1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,120
Man: Good afternoon, everyone.

2
00:00:01,120 --> 00:00:08,384
Just a reminder that the annual Spring Festival will be held this Saturday to celebrate the coming warm weather

3
00:00:08,384 --> 00:00:10,110
and the end of the school year.

4
00:00:10,110 --> 00:00:14,130
It will take place on the main campus lawn from 1 to 4 P.M.

5
00:00:14,130 --> 00:00:16,826
There will be food stands, games,

6
00:00:16,826 --> 00:00:21,010
and, from 3 to 4 P.M., live music from student bands.

7
00:00:21,010 --> 00:00:24,090
We hope you all can join us for a fun-filled day!
